      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability using a parameterized test to clearly express input/expected pairs and `assertAll` to group the deprecated vs. current API checks.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test uses a `@ParameterizedTest` with `@MethodSource` to make each input→expected mapping explicit in a data table, and `assertAll` with descriptive messages to clearly distinguish the deprecated `getCompressedFilename` check from the current `getCompressedFileName` check — same runtime behavior, much easier to read and extend."
